	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_147"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>It is called the “Mirage Pokémon"
because so few have seen it.
Its shed skin has been found.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
