	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_148"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>If its body takes on an aura, the
weather changes instantly. It is
said to live in seas and lakes.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>If its body takes on an aura, the
weather changes instantly. It is
said to live in seas and lakes.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
