	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_488"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>On nights around the quarter moon,
the aurora from its tail extends
and undulates beautifully.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>On nights around the quarter moon,
the aurora from its tail extends
and undulates beautifully.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>クレセリア
・シンオウ図鑑プラチナ版</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_489"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>It drifts in warm seas. It always
returns to where it was born, no
matter how far it may have drifted.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>It drifts in warm seas. It always
returns to where it was born, no
matter how far it may have drifted.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>フィオネ
・DPポケモンだがプラチナのROM内で入手不可</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_490"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>It is born with a wondrous power
that lets it bond with any kind of
Pokémon.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>It is born with a wondrous power
that lets it bond with any kind of
Pokémon.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>マナフィ
・DPポケモンだがプラチナのROM内で入手不可</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_491"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>To protect itself, it afflicts those
around it with nightmares. However,
it means no harm.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>To protect itself, it afflicts those
around it with nightmares. However,
it means no harm.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ダークライ
・DPポケモンだがプラチナのROM内で入手不可</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_492"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>The flowers all over its body burst
into bloom if it is lovingly hugged
and senses gratitude.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>The flowers all over its body burst
into bloom if it is lovingly hugged
and senses gratitude.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>シェイミ
・DPポケモンだがプラチナのROM内で入手不可</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_E_00_493"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>It is said to have emerged from an
egg in a place where there was
nothing, then shaped the world.</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
